  "content": "\n\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252flivepix.gg%252fheycronusmc\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1802/225/banner-donate-png.png\"></strong></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>透過 <strong>Smooth Glass</strong>，玻璃方塊呈現出更清晰、更優雅的外觀。過去會阻擋視線的分心細節已予以移除，帶來更流暢、更通透的視覺體驗。此外，玻璃邊緣現在採用更輕透的透明度，營造出更加柔和、和諧的外觀。</p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.paypal.com%252fdonate%252f%253fbusiness%253dLAEZJ6TS7CYP6%2526no_recurring%253d0%2526item_name%253dHelp%2bme%2bcontinue%2bwith%2bthe%2bprojects%2bwith%2ba%2bsimple%2bdonation%2b-%2bHeycronus%2526currency_code%253dUSD\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"font-weight:400;display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1013293/description_41c410a1-3705-48e1-9d6d-faca354f3234.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"248\" height=\"93\"></a></p>\n<p>這款材質包非常適合追求現代與極簡風格建造的玩家，能讓你的 Minecraft 世界中室內與室外環境融合得更自然。</p>\n<p><strong>主要特色</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>移除干擾視線的分心細節，提升視野清晰度。</li>\n<li>玻璃邊緣採用更輕透的透明度。</li>\n<li>適合現代與創意建造。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>讓你的建築更上一層樓，盡情享受 <strong>Smooth Glass</strong> 帶來的簡約之美！</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1291/574/sem-tatulo-2-png.png\"></p>",
